WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.340
In <00:00:00.200>the <00:00:00.340>Sermon <00:00:00.740>on <00:00:00.920>the <00:00:01.060>Mount,

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.860
Christ <00:00:02.080>moves <00:00:02.560>the <00:00:02.820>battle <00:00:03.120>from <00:00:03.380>the <00:00:03.560>hands

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:04.700
to <00:00:04.160>the <00:00:04.320>heart:

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.980
to <00:00:05.540>our <00:00:05.740>thoughts, <00:00:06.880>our <00:00:06.880>desires <00:00:07.820>and <00:00:07.840>our

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.420
